   "source": [
    "## 📚 Troubleshooting Guide\n",
    "\n",
    "### Common Issues and Solutions\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **No trades executed**\n",
    "   - Try more aggressive parameters (lower bb_period, atr_period)\n",
    "   - Reduce min_volatility threshold\n",
    "   - Check data quality and availability\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Data loading errors**\n",
    "   - Verify API keys and network connectivity\n",
    "   - Check data file paths and permissions\n",
    "   - Try different data sources\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Strategy calculation errors**\n",
    "   - Ensure sufficient historical data\n",
    "   - Check indicator parameters are reasonable\n",
    "   - Review error messages for specific issues\n",
    "\n",
    "4. **Backtest failures**\n",
    "   - Verify date ranges are valid\n",
    "   - Check for sufficient data in selected period\n",
    "   - Review risk management settings"
   ]
  }
 ]
